      "content": "i get that there are two sides, but if you look at the actual history and the way things have played out, doesn't it become pretty obvious that one side is just trying to maintain a democratic order while the other is just trying to expand its empire? like, is it even really a \"debate\" anymore if one side is clearly violating international law?",
